<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-057" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-057-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0003" ref="izi_e36_p1g">虞翻</persName>古之狂直，因難免乎末世，然<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0018" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>不能容，非曠宇也。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0028" ref="7ec_qvv_x1c">陸績</persName>之於<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0032" ref="5bd_a4e_ad6">揚</persName>《玄》，是<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0038" ref="fp6_ia6_7yw">仲尼</persName>之<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0041" ref="99j_eyj_m1z">左丘明</persName>，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0045" ref="99a_8f0_ec3">老聘</persName>之<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0048" ref="g1r_0em_2tf">嚴周</persName>矣；以瑚璉之器，而作守南越，不亦賊夫人歟！<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0071" ref="xuu_do0_zbf">張溫</persName>才藻俊茂，而智防未備，用致艱患。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0089" ref="7tc_utz_m7l">駱統</persName>抗明大義，辭切理至，值<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0102" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>方閉不開。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0108" ref="36u_j3u_i3z">陸瑁</persName>篤義規諫，君子有稱焉。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0121" ref="pax_gtm_aew">吾粲</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099:m0124" ref="ejj_vdz_hxw">朱據</persName>遭罹屯蹇，以正喪身，悲夫！</p>
</text>
